00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:33.004
Well, the first thing was is when you
learned about equilibrium is that there's

00:00:33.004 --> 00:00:34.974
this forward and reverse reaction.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:38.480
And when the rates of the two
two sides of the reaction become

00:00:38.519 --> 00:00:40.749
equal, equilibrium is achieved.

00:00:41.129 --> 00:00:45.089
Now behind all that, what essentially
